WEBVTT

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:02.563
And people ask me
"how do we do that?"

00:06:03.108 --> 00:06:04.679
But I know about common ground.

00:06:04.703 --> 00:06:06.827
I feel like we can build those bridges.

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:09.371
But it's not easy.

00:06:10.213 --> 00:06:12.056
I have a concept that I go back to,

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:14.810
and it's a concept that should
be familiar to everybody

00:06:14.834 --> 00:06:16.655
since the beginning of human history.

00:06:16.679 --> 00:06:18.162
It's the idea of the commons.

00:06:18.186 --> 00:06:20.339
This shared place
in the center of town --

00:06:20.363 --> 00:06:21.735
town square,

00:06:22.078 --> 00:06:23.239
the quad --

00:06:23.263 --> 00:06:25.342
but it's the place
where you come together,

00:06:25.366 --> 00:06:26.565
your community,

00:06:26.589 --> 00:06:29.597
and you can listen to people
on soapboxes with different ideas,

00:06:29.621 --> 00:06:31.116
and you can be very different,